      <h2 id="_csistoragecapacity_storagek8siov1" class="group scroll-mt-20">CSIStorageCapacity [storage.k8s.io/v1]<a href="#_csistoragecapacity_storagek8siov1" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
